  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building Readiness for Transition Finance in Thailand (Phase I)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">- The first step for firms to mobilize transition finance is to develop and disclose a credible and ambitious transition plan.- The goal of this project is to build capacity of Thailand&apos;s industrial and financial sector in developing and disclosing such transition plans.- In Phase I (2025), the deliverables are: (1) prepare a SEC-issued guideline on the disclosure requirements of IFRS S2 and ASEAN Transition Finance Guidance v2, and (2) organize a seminar to present the guideline.- This is the first project to be jointly implemented with Thailand&apos;s Securities &amp; Exchange Commission (SEC).</narrative>
  </description>
